1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,581
Ngozi is a nurse in Manchester.

2
00:00:02,581 --> 00:00:06,592
Her mother lives in Lagos, looked after by a carer, Bisi.

3
00:00:06,592 --> 00:00:14,403
Ngozi pays for the diesel, the medicine, and the odd emergency, usually from a hospital ward, between patients.

4
00:00:14,403 --> 00:00:18,343
Ngozi is a composite character, but the problem is real.

5
00:00:18,343 --> 00:00:24,746
A flat spending limit either blocks what Mum really needs, or lets a scam straight through.

6
00:00:25,933 --> 00:00:35,189
Ask Me First is an agent that pays the usual bills, asks about anything unusual, and remembers every answer on Walrus Memory, on Mainnet.

7
00:00:35,189 --> 00:00:37,959
So it never asks the same question twice.

8
00:00:38,967 --> 00:00:40,671
This is the live app.

9
00:00:40,671 --> 00:00:47,811
Memory on Walrus Mainnet, wallet checks through Tatum's Sui gRPC, and real Testnet USDC.

10
00:00:47,811 --> 00:00:50,326
Bisi asks for diesel, six USDC.

11
00:00:50,326 --> 00:00:56,817
The agent recalls that Ngozi approved Bisi, and that diesel cost six last month.

12
00:00:56,817 --> 00:01:02,253
Tatum confirms the wallet on Sui, so it pays, in real Testnet USDC.

13
00:01:03,267 --> 00:01:05,241
But Ngozi says that's too high.

14
00:01:05,241 --> 00:01:07,215
Diesel should be five, at most.

15
00:01:07,215 --> 00:01:11,481
Her own words are saved to Walrus Mainnet, in about twenty seconds.

16
00:01:11,481 --> 00:01:16,129
Same request again, and this time it asks, quoting her limit back to her.

17
00:01:19,267 --> 00:01:20,540
A new pharmacy wallet.

18
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:23,607
It has never seen it, so it asks instead of guessing.

19
00:01:23,607 --> 00:01:27,484
Ngozi approves it, and her answer is saved to Walrus for next time.

20
00:01:29,067 --> 00:01:33,290
Now a message that says urgent, account changed, sixty USDC.

21
00:01:33,290 --> 00:01:36,528
Text in a request can never approve a payment.

22
00:01:36,528 --> 00:01:37,583
Only Ngozi can.

23
00:01:39,567 --> 00:01:42,915
And if Tatum's check can't run, the agent can't verify the wallet.

24
00:01:42,915 --> 00:01:43,828
So no money moves.

25
00:01:47,567 --> 00:01:49,473
Every number is in the repo.

26
00:01:49,473 --> 00:01:52,945
A live judge run: eight of eight steps as expected.

27
00:01:52,945 --> 00:01:55,328
Fifteen memories on Walrus Mainnet.

28
00:01:55,328 --> 00:02:01,592
And in a month we scripted, thirty requests, a simple spending cap made nine wrong payments.

29
00:02:01,592 --> 00:02:08,809
Ask Me First made none, and asked Ngozi thirteen questions, against twenty-three with memory switched off.

30
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:10,753
Ask Me First.

31
00:02:10,753 --> 00:02:13,838
It pays what's normal, and asks about the rest.
